---
import DocsLayout from "../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout
  title="CLI reference"
  description="Command reference for the Considered CLI."
  current="/reference/"
>
  <article class="doc">
    <h1>CLI reference</h1>

    <h2><code>considered init</code></h2>
    <p>
      Writes a starter <code>.considered.yaml</code> to the repository root.
      Fails if the file already exists.
    </p>

    <h2><code>considered check</code></h2>
    <p>Evaluates the repository against the configuration.</p>
    <pre><code>considered check
considered check --json
considered check --sarif</code></pre>

    <h2><code>considered instructions</code></h2>
    <p>
      Prints the configured free-form instructions, or
      <code>(No instructions provided)</code> when the property is absent.
    </p>

    <h2><code>considered variance add</code></h2>
    <p>
      Captures a metric value as an approved variance boundary and writes it to
      the configuration.
    </p>
    <pre><code>considered variance add \
  --subject &lt;path&gt; \
  --metric &lt;metric&gt; \
  --kind &lt;kind&gt; \
  --reason &lt;reason&gt;</code></pre>
    <p>
      Add <code>--metric-reason &lt;reason&gt;</code> for an optional metric-specific
      explanation. Missing subject, metric, kind, and reason values are prompted
      for interactively.
    </p>

    <h2><code>considered version</code></h2>
    <p>Prints the CLI version. <code>--version</code> and <code>-v</code> are aliases.</p>

    <h2>Common flags</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Flag</th>
          <th>Meaning</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><code>--root &lt;dir&gt;</code></td>
          <td>For init, check, instructions, and variance add. Defaults to the current directory.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><code>--config &lt;file&gt;</code></td>
          <td>For check, instructions, and variance add. Defaults to <code>&lt;root&gt;/.considered.yaml</code>. An explicit relative path is resolved from the current working directory.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </article>
</DocsLayout>
